# Local dev test keys (always pass): https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/troubleshooting/testing/
# TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=1x00000000000000000000AA
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=1x0000000000000000000000000000000AA
#
# Production — copy Site Key and Secret Key from your widget (they are different values):
